<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Obitrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa kikyikyo bwabo ko Obitrus</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Obitrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Obt</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa kikyikyo bwabo ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Obitrus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Enena mani bwabo ko Obitrus oyikoko ko Oyesu Okristi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Gebe kase ko Owuso ni oshu ni, awase ni nyinya kefu go okpagye ko Opontus kpo Ogalatiya kpo Okapadokiya kpo Asiya, kpo Obitiniya ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Ala ni Owuso Ada kaha shala ipu ko yoya nu, okyalatu bwebe ko Omaku, shini ala geyagye do Oyesu Okristi, shini oyi nu na yo ozalabi kala na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Oneshi kpo omene na wa ka kala nwashika.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyitagye Neshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />An shotunehe do Owuso Ada ka Adole Oyesu Okristi! Ipu ki iyinyinyi nu odaha olayi pepe bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi ni oshiyi bwikwu. Omani yaha gbi iyitagye ko olayi pepe, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />kweyi aha ba gbeyi ko rogwu ka aboneshi ni Owuso yitagye dase nu. Oyitagye daha iso, ebeni oya wowa lo, kwe ya yishi lo, kwe oyasa lo ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Otunehe mani wa akakala, awase ni bwebe ko otuse, oshu ko Owuso ngmaha ikweyi ko olayi ni okwobonu shaha okweyi kishi ni.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ala shotunehe ikweyi koza mani, owotiri shotu kala na bya kishi gbayayi, koni aba malama, ala ba mowe gogo-gogo. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Owe mani gbodagye shini ana mamo otuse kala wo kwokwoshi. Ozinariya, ni ya yishi ni aba moma kpo ola, mamani otuse kala ni sho ozinariya ni aba moma shini na rese. Ala ziye shosha kpi igyashi kpa abokpa eno ni Oyesu Okristi yawa ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ala yimu nu, koni ala omo lo ni, kweyi ala kyogwu kpanu koni ala mo lo ni. Mani oni otunehe kala ni gbigyashi ni sheyi gagye, ni okwunu kala ya gege ya ka lo, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ikweyi koni opyo ngmongma ko Omaku ni wi ikweyi kotuse ni ipu nu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Ikweyi ko ngmongma mani awinobane zishi wa ba ikpo kweyi abane ikweyi keshi ni Owuso ya dala ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Atakirikwu ko gyi ishi ni oza mani wa gbodagye ni kpo owe ni oya gbodagye ni. Omani wi ishini Omaku ko Okristi ni yi ikpiye wa kada wa ikweyi ko owe ni Okristi wa ma ni kpi igyashi ni oya gbo ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Owuso sayi da awobane mani mo, omani woko ikweyi ki iyiwa lalo ke wi ikweyi kala, byo ni akela ikweyi koza ni ala pwo anani bwebe ka ayoleho ni tono koshu neshi dawo bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso ni bwi iso ni. Omani wa awoza ni ayoleho ba yimu ko gye ni.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owuso Yahogwu ko Yagye Neshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Mani oni, ala kyi iyi kala tu koyoko. Ala yiyitagye da aboneshi ni aba dala eno ni Oyesu Okristi ya wa ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ala geyagye do Owuso bya ayileke, ala ka yi imoza bibi na kpa ala ogwu byi ishini ala bebe dibu ni lo. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Yoza gyogye byoni Owuso ni yogwu ni yo gyogye ni, awo ki yo gyogye ipu koza ni oyaya kpiri. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso kamo: &lt;&lt;Yo gyogye byoni ami yo gyogye ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ishini ala ba tinarigwu do Owuso, ala ba yogwu mo Ada, awo ni ya kepwo kananoho gyogye kpo oza ni oya ni, mani oni, ipu ko olayi wo ese mani, yagye sho geyagye do Owuso byoni oya yimu ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ala gye mo oza ni Owuso yoko kpanu ko angmala shi ipu ko oza bibi ni ala rogwu bwebe ka awokyikyi kala ni le bya azurupa kwe ozinariya ni ba yishi ni lalo. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Opopa ni ake pa ni wo Okristi ni le byo Oyi Kotukpo ni gbinyi ikpiye nu lo ni ko ngmala. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Owuso sho ome oyese mani la, oke wa eno ko gwejeji mani ikweyi ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Bwebe nu ala kyogwu kpo Owuso, ni shiyi bwikwu kweyi danu igyashi; oza ni ya ni ala yotuse kpi iyitagye kala do Owuso. <verse eid="1PE 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Anani ala geyagye do kwokwoshi, ala yi iyi kala na, ala gbimu kotata kpa ayene kala ni gbotuse, ala yimu kiyi kala kpotu oye kponu. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ikweyi koni Owuso daha olayi pepe, ni we edo ni ya yishi lo ni, oke we edo ni ya yishi lo ko ogbogbo-gbogbo, bwebe koshu kela ko Owuso ni gbo olayi kweyi kiyo ko gbogbo-gbogbo. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso kani mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Kpiri kase lema byi ikyashi la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">igyashi wa kpiri lema byo oshepu ki ikyashi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Ikyashi shoha, kweyi oshepu ya gwo shonu,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ela ka Adole ke yaba ko gbogbo-gbogbo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Omani pini wo ono ni Oshu Neshi tono dala ni oma.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Okpo ko Olayi kpa Ase ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ni olemani oni, ala shoza bibi bita, okwunu fofu kpo kame kpo yoza iyi kpa anya yoya, kpo yase ishi kpe esasosa. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ala le bya ayi meme ni ba yimu kinyi kame neshi ishi kpiri ko gwa, ishini ala gwa ala ba gye, kweyi Owuso ya ngmala. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso kani, &lt;&lt;Ala ma ki gye ma Adole shoshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Ala webe ka Adole, akyo ni gbo olayi ni. Ni ase tela nu mo owojije lo ni, Owuso ke sho kweyi shoshi sheyi gagye danu. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Ala wa bya awakyo ni gbo olayi ni, ala shuwabita shini ana yoko kpala ko mole ko Owuso, ebe ni ala ba yoko bya awosapa neshi ko peshi ni Owuso ya yimu, bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Nshikyikpo neneshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ni nyya yi kwu wite kole ni nyyo kwagye Osiyona ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">kpiri kase ni kyogwu kpa akyo mani oya gbowuru lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Anani ebe kawase ni kyogwu, kpa akyo mani amo woza neshi. Ebe kawase ni kyogwu kpa nu lo ni ke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Akyo ni awomoda tela nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">pini pya shoshi she la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Kweyi Okpa oye ki kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Akyo ni ya yase ya shikawu ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">kpo okpo ni ya yase ya gbo ni.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Aba shikawu ikweyi koni akyogwu kpe ela ko Owuso lo, omani wo oza ni Owuso gbo dawa ni oma.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ala ke wa ase ni Owuso shu, ayose ko Owuso ose, agye ni gbi igyashi, awase ko Owuso, ni oshuwa shini ana ko oza ki igbashi ni Owuso ya ni, oyaha ogwu shipu kebe dibu wipu kebe yoyu ki igbashi nu. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Ishi oye ala wase ko Owuso lo, anani ke ala wase ko Owuso; ishi oye ala gyi iyinyinyi ko Owuso lo, anani ke ala pyi iyinyinyi nu wa.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awoshe ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ayene hin moshi, nyya bala, ni wo ogboga kpa wo nyinya kefu ese mani! Ala nwanyi kpo oza bibi ni ikpiye ya yimu, ki ya kpefu kpo omaku kala ishi kpiri ni. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ala kwiyi kala neshi ipu kawase ni gyo Owuso lo ni, shini owoni akwala epwo mala nyowe, aba moza neshi ni ala yani kweyi aba sho Owuso iye eno ni oya wa nu.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ala geyagye dase kpiri abishi ka Adole, ala geyagye dose ni ya kpogwu kase kpiri ni, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />kwe awoteyi kokpagye, ni ashuwa ko gbawase ni ba yo bibi ogo agye, kweyi zabokpa dase ni ba yoneshi ni. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ozani Owuso ya yimu shini ahan yani yoma, owoni ayo neshi awikyo ni ba ko obibi basha. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ahan bagye byase ni pyo minyo, ka yoko kpo ominyo wo shini oyabo kobibi lo; yagye byo oshe ko Owuso. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Geyagye neshi da ananoho: yimu kase ni gbotuse bya ala, do Owuso abokpa, kweyi ogeyagye do Ose.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edo ko Owe Moma ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Ala awoshe ala ziyi kala da Adole kala kweyi geyagye dawa kokwokwoshi, ka geyagye da awase ni bayo neshi kpi iyinyinyi kin ni lo, ke ya mama ni da awase ni ba ya ala obibi ni. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Owuso ya sa aboneshi, owoni ozotu kpo dose kpo owe moma koni gye mo owo oyoya ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Abola wo ke yini, owoni ozotu kpi ize gwogwo ikweyi koni oyo zalabi ni? Owoni oke zotu kpo owe koni oyoza neshi ni, Owuso ya sa aboneshi ikweyi nu. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ikweyi koni pini Owuso yogwu la, mamani Okristi mowe ikweyi wo shini na wowe ko gba nu. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Oke yo ozalabi oyoye lo, kweyi ashishe ke pwela kokame bwo okwunu nu lo. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ishini asesa ni oshokwunu lo, ishini oya mowe ni oyanya lo, oke zotu nu do Owuso, ino kepwo neshi. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Okristi abiyinu zo ozalabi ka ikpiye nu gikweyi koshi, shini an gekwu dozalabi kweyi gbolayi do oza neshi. Bwebe ko ofo ni ayo ni pini aha pyo ogege la. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ala lema byo otukpo ni gebi owe ni, kweyi anani akwikye ala wa ko gboso inogbeho kobize kpase ni ya yiyi kwo olayi ka ni.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Anya kpo Oba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ni olemani, anya owotiri shini ala geyagye da awoba kala, owoni ashe ipu wa kyogwu kpe ela ko Owuso lo, oza yoya kala ya yawoba kala ba kyogwu. Ko owoni ala koje kponu lo, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />ikweyi koni aba mo neshi ko ogeyagye do Owuso kala. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Oshi kala naka wa ko gwagya kikpiye lo, kwe eyi otota kpo otiyegba kwo shoshiye neshi lo. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Oshi wo ke na wa koza ni yawa bwipu kotu wo ni, oshi ni ya sa lo ni, zikweyi iso lo kpo omaku mene, edo koshi mani woza nyakwu ebe ko Owuso. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Koni owe mani pini anya kema ni yi iyitagye do Owuso ni ba yi iyiwa shoshi bwebe ko geyagye da awobuwa. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Osera lemani la; ogeyagye di Ibirayi kweyi oyogwu ma adole nu. Anani awo woyi nu owoni oyo neshi kyi gboshi kojije lo.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Mamani awoba, owotiri shala bagye kpa anya kala kweyi ala gye ma aloshu ikpiye fala lo. Ala byuwa neneshi, ikweyi koni aba pyeshi ko olayi kpa ala dudu. Ala ya mani shini ojije naka yi inarigwu tota kala na yishi lo.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owe moma ko Oyoneshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Ko gwejeji: owotiri shini oza yoya kotu kpi imu yoya kala na woye kponu; ala yimu kiyi kala, kweyi ala gbi iyinynyi kweyi ki wiyi kala shu. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Ala ka sore ko bibi kpo obibi lo kwe ase ni sesa ka sesa lo; mani oni, sore kpa aboneshi, ikweyi koni aboneshi pini woza ni Owuso shokoyi ishini oyala ogwu ni la. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Byo ni Okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&lt;&lt;Owoni oyayimu ko monye ko olayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kweyi oyimu ko meno neshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">shela bibi bita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kweyi sho okame bita.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Owotiri shini opyitikpi to oza bibi shini oyo oza neshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">owotiri shini otikpo kotu mene kpo otu oye kponu.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Koni Adole ya yi iyi kwase neneshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">kweyi ya pwi inarigwu wa ishi kpiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">oke ya byotu kpa awino yo ozalabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Anoho ya yofo owoni oya takirikwu ko yoza neshi? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Owoni oke mowe ikweyi ko yo neshi, otunehe wo ya lemoji! Ka yoshi ka ashishe lo, kweyi ka byotu lo. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ni olemani oni yo Okristi tipu kotu wo, kweyi geyagye danu bya Adole wo. Wiyoshu ishi kpiri ko kyogwu kpa ananoho ni wa doka ko kyogwu ikweyi ki iyitagye ni ogbo ni. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Ke kyogwu kpo okomene kweyi muwa gyiyi. Otuwo na woye kponu, shini awase ni ba sesa ikweyi koni oyayo neshi ipu kiye ko Okristi ni ana yiweyi kela ni aka ni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Oya shoshi sho mowe ikweyi koyo neshi, owoni owo okyokye kotu ko Owuso, oshoshi sho ozalabi. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Okristi abiyinu gekwu ikweyi ka igboye kpokponu, oki gekwu ikweyi ka awinozalabi, ase neshi gekwu kase labi shini na byaha gebe ko Owuso, ayo ngmo bya angma ananoho ni, kweyi onyiso ikwu bwebe koshu ko Omaku kweyi ogbo olayi, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />ishini oyiyi byo Omaku ni, oga tono da awomaku ni bo oruduru ni. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Omani wo Omaku kawase ni tela ko geyagye do Owuso ishini ozotu ya gbeyi wa ipu ki ishini Onuhu ya gbowu ni. Ishi oni ase gbayayi pini bipu ko owu, kpiri wase ahata ni inyo ruwa lo ni, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />ni woyi ni ya myabo obatisma, ni ya ngmaha anani. Awo ko ninyi kikpiye lalo, oke wokoyi neshi ni ashe do Owuso kpo otu oye. Ongmaha bwebe ko nyiso ko Oyesu Okristi bwikwu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />anu ni giso ga yagye abore ko Owuso, oya kpogwu ka ayoleho kpiri, igabo kpa awoshu ni biso ni.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Yagye do Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Byoni Okristi mowe ipu kikpiye ni, awo wiyo shu koya mamani, ikweyi koni ase ni mowe ipu kikpiye ya yo ozalabi kelo. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Bwa anani gohobu, oyagye wo ese mani na woza ni Owuso ya yimu ni, woza ni otu wo ya yimu ni lalo. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Koni nekye-nekye ala kwobonu ngmishi nwashika ba yoza ni awase ni gyo Owuso lo ba yimu ko ya ni. Ala bagye ba beba, ba mehe kanya kpa ango, ba gwinyi ya, ba tigiga keba, ba gwinyi shoshu, ba geyagye de eka. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Anani igbashi ya awase ni gyo Owuso lo ni kwu, ni amala ba yawoza shushukwu mani kpa awa kelo ni, kweyi aba sala esa. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Awa ke ba wa kojoji ni aya ni do Owuso ni kwobonu gbomu ko kepwo kawase ni biyi kpa awase ni gekwu ni. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Oza ni ya ni aba tono ko Oshu Neshi da awase ni gekwu ni mamani oma, shini ana wa kepwo wa gyogye kpa awase ni biyi ni; atono dawa shini ana bagye byoni Owuso ya yimu ipu ko Omaku ni.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adole ni ya Byeshi ko Owuso Neshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Okweyi kojoji baha piya. Ala wiyi kala shu kweyi ala hagye giri shala tinarigwu. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Oni she kpiri yoma, ala yimu kiyi kala ko kwokwoshi, ikweyi koni imu ya byo ozalabi otu lo. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ala ya anano omaba ipu kole kala katiya lo. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Anano wa adole keshi ko Owuso gogo-gogo, ase ni yagege ona tase ashini abo kpeshi ni opye bwebe ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ase ni ya kela ko Owuso, na koshu neshi ko Owuso. Ase ni yayo ko, naya kpo oshu ko Owuso, shini ipu koza kpiri iye shosha nawa ko Owuso bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi, anu ni gbigyashi kpo oshu ko gbogbo-gbogbo. Nalemani.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owe moma kawo Gboso Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ayene hin moshi, onaka woza kigbashi dala lo, ikweyi ko owe ni ala ba mani, onaka woza pepe ebe kala lo, ala kamo byo owoza pepe ni tala ebyibye wa lo ni. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ni olemani ala shotunehe koni ala ba medo ko owe ni Okristi mani, shini ala shotunehe nwashika kpanu ishini oya sayi igyashi nu dala. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Owoni asala esa ikweyi kiye ko Okristi, ala shotunehe koni oshu ko Omaku ko Owuso yo kpa ala. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Owoni omowe, onaka le byo owino gmase kwe owi kwe ase ni ya kyono igbo kwe kpemu kwela kase. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Owoni oke omowe ikweyi koni oya gboso Oyesu, ka yiweyi lo, shotunehe do Owuso koni oriye ko Okristi. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ishi ko kepwo yawa, aba kwotu kepwo koka kpawase ko Owuso ikyikyo. Owoni akwotu kpaha, okweyi nu ya lemoji da awase ni kyogwu kpo Oshu Neshi ko Owuso ni? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Byoni Okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Oya lono ko ngmase neshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">oya lemoji da awase ni gyo Owuso lo? Ikweyi koni aba yo ozalabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ni olemani oni, awase ni mowe ikweyi koni ayoza ni Owuso ya yimu ni, ana gohobu kpo neshi, ana yi iyiwa da ase ni yuwa ni, oya byo okoyi nu ni oshe da awa ishi kpiri.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Ikpo ko Otukpo ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Nyya ba awanyakwase ni bipu kala ni, ami ni wanyakwase abiyun ni, ami olobene ko owe moma ko Okristi, ami ki yawa gbingbo ki igyashi ni ya wa bose ni. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Shini ala wa awogbeho ko obize ni Owuso dala ni, ko yiyi kwuwa kpo otu oye kponu, byoni Owuso ya yimu ni, ka ya bya abyo koshu lo. Ka ya koni aba sore ni lo, ke ya koni ogbimu koya ni. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Ka yawase ni adawo ko yiyi kwuwa ni oza koshu lo, ke yoza ni aba gba ebe wo ni. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Shini ishini Inogbeho Nyakwu bose, oya lo otu kigyashi ni ya gba lo ni.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Mamani ala ayileke ala geyagye da awanyakwase kala. Kpiri kala ala sho oshiye ko yikweyi bagye, shini ala yoko diyikala, koni okpa kamo, &lt;&lt;Owuso ya tela kino zikweyi iso, ase ni ke ya yikweyi bagye oya yoneshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Yikweyi bagye, ipu koshu kabo ko Owuso, shini anu na ngawo iso ipu kishi neshi nu. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Kpojoji ni ya shiwo wo ni shikweyi, ikweyi koni oya dotose wo.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ala gbera, ala wiyikala shu! Ibiri ni wo omonyekwotu kala ni ya gyehe bya abaga niya wonu ni, ya labo kase noya yi sha ha ni. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ala ka kyo ogwu lo, ala hagye giri ipu kotuse, ikweyi koni ala gye mo ayene kala shishini ipu kese kpiri ba medo ko owe ni ala ba ma ni. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ishini ala mowe kishi gbayayi, Owuso ine ke eshi kpiri, ni yala ogwu ko gbingbo ipu kigyashi nu ko gbogbo ipu ko Okristi ni, anu abiyinu ya kyala tu kweyi ya dala oshu, ki ya yala ba gbogba neshi. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Oshu wakakanu ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbogba ko Ogwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Osila pini tumabo tenena mani la, nggye mo owino gboso Okristi kokwokwoshi. Nyya yimu ko tala otugbagba ki ka dala mo omani pini we eshi ko Owuso ko kwokwoshi la. Ala hagye giri ipu nu.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Oda ko Owuso ko Obabila, ni Owuso shuwa kpala dudu ni ba talogbogba, oyi hin ko Omarkus ya tala ogbogba mamani. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ala tiyikala ogbogba kweyi kwiyi kala botu ipu kimu ko Okristi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Omene nayo kpala kpiri ni wako Okristi ni.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>